// @no-instantiate
// MISCOMPILE, pinned: a NESTED MAP whose INNER map's value is an ANONYMOUS object shape
// (`{[string]: {[string]: {r:i32}}}`, never spelled). Eight lines, no import, no lambda, no
// list, no generic, and NOT ONE DECLARED TYPE — which is what makes it a better specimen
// than its predecessor: every axis the last five specimens turned on (a union, an ARM, an
// exact layout twin, a hand-written generic, a declaration order) is absent here.
// `vl check` exits 0 with NO diagnostics at all and is the ONLY command that misses it;
// `vl check --codegen` exits 1, `vl build` writes the `.wasm` and exits 1, `vl run` exits 1:
//
//   the emitted module is not valid wasm … type mismatch:
//   expected (ref null $type), found (ref $type)
//
// (No byte offset quoted on purpose: it moves with the seed. The message is the stable
//  identifier — and note it is the NULLABILITY that differs, not the heap type, which is
//  the tell that this is a vals-cell nullability seam and not the two-heap-types family
//  every recent specimen came from.)
//
// THE CONTAINER IS THE AXIS. One nesting level less runs: `{[string]: {r:i32}}` built and
// read the same way prints 7. So does the same nested map with a MONO inner value
// (`{[string]: {[string]: i32}}`). It is the inner map's REF value cell, reached through
// the outer map's read, that the emitter types non-null while the read produces a nullable.
//
// PRE-EXISTING on `764ad0dd`, same sentence — not a regression from the change this file
// ships with. Filed as `silent-class-inventory.md` D112; on the D88/D100 grid it is 570
// `cont=nestedmap` cells, the single largest remaining silent family.
//
// IT IS THE SPECIMEN. This file is kept byte-for-byte identical to
// `tests/vl_check_codegen_test.ts`'s `INVALID_MODULE_SRC` below its header, which needs a
// program that type-checks clean and whose module the engine refuses.
//
// WHEN IT IS FIXED this file starts failing (the module instantiates), which is the point:
// delete it, graduate a `@run` row, and swap `INVALID_MODULE_SRC` for another live member of
// the class. READ THE NOTE IN `tests/vl_check_codegen_test.ts` BEFORE DOING THAT — including
// what it says about where to look before concluding the class is empty, and the sixth
// source it carries: re-grade an EARLIER change's grid against today's master.
function mk(n: i32) {
  const i0 = Map()
  i0["k"] = { r: n }
  const c = Map()
  c["o"] = i0
  return c
}
print((((mk(7))["o"] ?? Map())["k"] ?? { r: 0 }).r)
